{"asset_key":"ep6/herohub_story_16411221","episode":"ep6","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"16411221","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1641122101:1":{"text":"ごくごく……冷たくて甘ーい！このシュワシュワな魔法のアイスドリンク、飲むとお腹の中で花火みたいにぶくぶく弾けるんです！","source_cn":"咕噜噜……好凉好甜！这杯魔法冰饮里有好多小气泡，喝下去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60887650A9B3DC37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1641122102:1":{"text":"ぷはぁ――まさに、喉ごしスッキリ！","source_cn":"哈啊——好爽快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C0209E06AC085C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1641122103:1":{"text":"……全部飲み干したの？それ、一壺分はあったでしょう。","source_cn":"……你都喝光了？那可是一整壶的份量吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41FB75986C4B1DA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1641122104:1":{"text":"だって、勝手に泡が出るんだもん。飲み切らないと泡が逃げちゃうよ！","source_cn":"没办法嘛，它自己在冒泡泡，我不喝完泡泡就会跑掉的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD10D332BBCF9957A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1641122105:1":{"text":"本当に大丈夫かしら……お腹がまん丸に膨らんできてるわ。","source_cn":"真的没事吗……你的肚子都鼓起来了，比之前还要圆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6FBE446A6670EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1641122106:1":{"text":"うぐぐ、もう歩けない……お腹が重い。","source_cn":"呜哇，真的走不动了……肚子好沉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE28F183676F977F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1641122107:1":{"text":"マスター、ロンロン立てません……お願い、引っ張って……","source_cn":"主人，我站不起来了……你们拉我一把吧……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x31AB35A905826610","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、ロンロン立てません……お願い、引っ張って……","female":"マスター、ロンロン立てません……お願い、引っ張って……","variant_male_record_index":"211191","variant_female_record_index":"211192","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}